{"ref":"BDB, נָגַף","hw":"נָגַף","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָגַף</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. strike, smite (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">נְגַף</span><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.15\">2 Ch 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.22\">Is 19:22</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">וְ</span> consec.); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְגָפוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.18\">2 Ch 21:18</a>, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגֹּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:35\" href=\"/Exodus.21.35\">Ex 21:35</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּגֹּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:35\" href=\"/Exodus.32.35\">Ex 32:35</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶגּוֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:24\" href=\"/Psalms.89.24\">ψ 89:24</a> +, etc.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָגֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.22\">Is 19:22</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְגֹּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:23\" href=\"/Exodus.12.23\">Ex 12:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָגְפוֹ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:27\" href=\"/Exodus.12.27\">27</a>;—<em>strike, smite</em>, of serious (even fatal) injury, sq. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:22\" href=\"/Exodus.21.22\">Ex 21:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:35\" href=\"/Exodus.21.35\">35</a> (E); one’s foot against <span dir=\"rtl\">(בְּ)</span> stone <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:12\" href=\"/Psalms.91.12\">ψ 91:12</a>; abs. (stumble) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.23\">Pr 3:23</a>; especially of judgment, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, obj. individ. (fatal stroke) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:38\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.38\">1 S 25:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.10\">26:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.15\">2 S 12:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.20\">2 Ch 13:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.18\">21:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לָחֳלִי)</span>; obj. people (abs.) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:23\" href=\"/Exodus.12.23\">Ex 12:23</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:27\" href=\"/Exodus.12.27\">27</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:35\" href=\"/Exodus.32.35\">32:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:5\" href=\"/Joshua.24.5\">Jos 24:5</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.22\">Is 19:22</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.22\">22</a>; v. also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:24\" href=\"/Psalms.89.24\">ψ 89:24</a>; cf. c. acc. cogn. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגֵּפָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.12\">Zc 14:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:18\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.14\">2 Ch 21:14</a> (sq. also <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעַמֶּ֑ךָ</span>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> instr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:27\" href=\"/Exodus.7.27\">Ex 7:27</a>; of causing defeat in battle, sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:35\" href=\"/Judges.20.35\">Ju 20:35</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.3\">1 S 4:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.15\">2 Ch 13:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.11\">14:11</a>.<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגַּף</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.15\">2 S 10:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְּפוּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.19\">19</a> + 2 times, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִנָּגֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.24\">2 Ch 6:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּנָּגֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.2\">1 S 4:2</a> + 4 times; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגּוֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:39\" href=\"/Judges.20.39\">Ju 20:39</a>; cstr. <span 